'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Issued on [[Liberty Day]], October 26th, 2025, to all [[Helldiver]]s who logged in between August 28th and October 26th, 2025.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref>

== Lore ==
Issued to all Helldivers for their triumph on Liberty Day, having had successfully {{MajorOrderLink | id = A2-10-5 | text = killed 40 million enemies of democracy}} using only the [[R-2124 Constitution]].

